    "note": "Source-independent one-shot delayed beginning-of-step packets retain the creating controller and exact return-link context. Casey draws three on resolving entry and randomly discards only at that controller next upkeep, including departed/reentered sources and short/empty hands. Delayed triggers do not re-trigger permanent ability multiplicity; random state and capacity failures participate in owned rollback."
